WEBVTT

NOTE
The assassination attempt sequence. Irvine Kinneas positions himself as a sniper on the clock tower or Gateway rooftop overlooking Deling City. His target is Sorceress Edea, riding on her elaborate parade float. The tension builds as he takes aim, hesitates, fires, but Edea's sorcery deflects the bullet. Duration: approximately 40 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Irvine Kinneas lies prone on a high rooftop overlooking Deling City. Evening twilight illuminates the cityscape below. He wears his duster jacket and cowboy hat, his body positioned along a sniper rifle with a mounted scope. His breathing is controlled but tense.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Through the rifle scope, a magnified view appears. The crosshairs are centered on the street below. Sorceress Edea's elaborate parade float moves into view, decorated with ornate columns and elaborate designs. The float is pulled by magitek or mechanical means down the Deling City street.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The scope magnifies further. Edea stands imperiously on the center of the float, her horned headdress silhouetted against the sky. She wears her ceremonial dark dress. Her posture is regal and commanding. Citizens line the streets below, watching the parade pass.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Irvine's face is shown in close-up as he peers through the scope. His jaw is set with determination, but his eyes betray doubt and internal conflict. Beads of sweat form on his forehead. His hands grip the rifle tightly.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Irvine's finger approaches the trigger. His hand trembles slightly. Conflict plays across his expression. The moment stretches. He hesitates, his breathing becoming more shallow and rapid as he wrestles with his resolve.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Through the scope again, Edea remains in the crosshairs, unaware of the sniper's presence. The float continues down the street. The target is perfectly positioned. The moment of decision has arrived.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Irvine closes his eyes for a brief moment. His jaw clenches. His hand steadies on the trigger. He takes a deep breath. His expression hardens with grim determination as he opens his eyes.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Irvine pulls the trigger. The rifle recoils slightly. A sharp crack echoes through the city as the bullet is fired from the high rooftop position, hurtling toward its distant target below.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
The bullet streaks through the air in slow motion, a thin metallic projectile arcing down toward the parade float. It travels across the cityscape, the trajectory true and certain.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Edea remains standing on the float, her hand raised slightly. Her eyes narrow. A wave of magical energy emanates from her, visible as a shimmer or distortion in the air. A magical barrier begins to form around her.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The bullet approaches Edea at high speed, the killing shot moments away from impact. Her barrier becomes visible as a shimmering, translucent shield of crystalline ice or magical force.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The bullet strikes the magical barrier. Time seems to slow. The projectile stops in mid-air, its momentum completely arrested by Edea's sorcery. It hovers, suspended just inches from her, before dropping harmlessly to the float's surface below.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.500
The barrier dissipates as Edea lowers her hand. Her expression is calm and dismissive. She has survived the assassination attempt effortlessly. The barrier crumbles into wisps of magical energy.
